flowchart TD
  A[Candidate observation] --> B{Plate quality}
  B -->|strong / exact| C[ANPR dominates]
  C --> C1[ReID skipped or diagnostic only]
  C1 --> Z[Identity source ANPR]
  B -->|partial / degraded| D[Plate score + ReID score + time + feasibility]
  D --> E{Plausible and corroborated?}
  E -->|yes| F[ANPR_REID_SUPPORT]
  E -->|no| G[Review / reject]
  B -->|none usable| H[Appearance + time + feasibility]
  H --> I[REID_REVIEW only]
  D --> J{Physically infeasible?}
  J -->|yes| K[Strong penalty / reject]
  J -->|no| E
  H --> L{Stale stream epoch?}
  L -->|yes| K
  L -->|no| I
